<title>SINGAPORE: Insurance Corp. 96 net falls 21 pct.</title>
<headline>Insurance Corp. 96 net falls 21 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     14.39 vs   18.24</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)		    3.00 vs    3.00</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		    28.58 vs   36.31</p>
